# Gitignored files every new worktree needs, in gitignore syntax. Claude Code
# copies these into the worktrees it makes itself (Agent `isolation: worktree`,
# `--worktree`); `mise run worktree:new` reads this same file, so it is the one
# list for both.
#
# COPIED, never symlinked: a linked native/bin would let a worktree's
# `native:build` overwrite the main checkout's binary.

# The blade solver GDExtension — gitignored build output, but every melee
# swing push_errors without it (see docs/domain/blade-native.md).
/native/bin/
